    <item>
      <title>印尼咖啡连锁连锁店在雅加达贸易首次亮相中跃升了34％</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/indonesian-coffee-chain-fore-jumps-34-in-jakarta-trading-debut</link>
      <description><![CDATA[PT Fore Kopi印度尼西亚在其在雅加达的交易首次亮相时飙升，投资者耸了耸肩，关税可能会伤害当地咖啡连锁连锁店出售Pandan味的武士的能力。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/indonesian-coffee-chain-fore-jumps-34-in-jakarta-trading-debut</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 03:57:23 GMT</pubDate>
