    <item>
      <title>美国鞋类团体认为产品短缺的风险</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/us-footwear-group-sees-risk-of-product-shortages-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[鞋类分销商和美国零售商的总裁兼首席执行官马特·普里斯特（Matt Priest）表示，该行业的公司正在看到许多订单被取消，尤其是对于来自中国的产品，关税战争升级。他讨论了贸易战如何影响彭博社上的鞋类行业和消费者：中国展览。他与David Ingles和Annabelle Droulers交谈。  （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/us-footwear-group-sees-risk-of-product-shortages-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 03:28:50 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>尽管印度尼西亚的外国储备金达到了卢比，但</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/indonesia-s-foreign-reserves-hit-record-high-despite-rupiah-rout</link>
      <description><![CDATA[印度尼西亚的外汇储备上个月获得了26亿美元，即使全球市场动荡袭击了印第安纳州，也达到了另一个创纪录的纪录。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/indonesia-s-foreign-reserves-hit-record-high-despite-rupiah-rout</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 03:25:10 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当投资者下注更好的关税条款时，技术股票攀升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/asian-tech-stocks-climb-amid-mixed-signals-on-tariff-reprieve</link>
      <description><![CDATA[全球技术股票周一攀升，因为投资者表示乐观，认为该行业可能会赢得美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）最终确定关税计划时的一些让步。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/asian-tech-stocks-climb-amid-mixed-signals-on-tariff-reprieve</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:45:15 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票期货随着交易者的消化简短技术关税缓刑而上升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/stock-futures-rise-as-traders-digest-brief-tech-tariff-reprieve</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着投资者从特朗普政府进行了对电话，计算机和受欢迎的消费电子电子产品的互惠关税豁免的来回征收，美国股票期货获得了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/stock-futures-rise-as-traders-digest-brief-tech-tariff-reprieve</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 23:00:47 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票收益暂停技术关税，美元瀑布：市场包装</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普总统在一系列消费电子产品上停止进口关税后，亚洲股票提高了，在市场动荡不安的一周之后提升了情绪。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>贸易战风险降低了石油边缘，伊朗对</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-14</link>
      <description><![CDATA[当贸易商权衡贸易战争中的最新举动以及华盛顿和德黑兰之间的“建设性”谈判时，石油下降了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-14</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:36:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当关税传奇卷起时，美元降至全年的新鲜低点</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</link>
      <description><![CDATA[当交易者对某些电子关税的征收以及唐纳德·特朗普总统轻描淡写对技术领域的豁免后，贸易商越过了缓刑。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:09:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
